{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When simplified <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/9485c2cf3f7c0950c683797baca115f21d770abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-\\frac{1}{125})^{-2/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" /> becomes:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc4e7c10dc323681afe23b366e966a2ec6e3ab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{25} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{1}{25} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 25\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -25\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 25\\sqrt{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"487\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To remove the negative exponent, flip the fraction of the base.  This results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/7/267250b3b4008d96fe706dd9ae18fe1510d78007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-125)^{2/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Then, cube root <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b185bb213668e5001f7f05de7cfdbbf0687f8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and and square the result to get the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p><b>Step 1: Rewrite the negative exponent.</b>\n</p><p>For any nonzero number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/1765c005e2b0a6539b60db79d0766f03212baa65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u^{-2/3}=1/u^{2/3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"23\" />. Hence\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/3/b430185953078043ad09d30984974518316a42af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(-\\frac1{125}\\right)^{-2/3}=\\frac{1}{\\left(-\\frac1{125}\\right)^{2/3}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -25px\" width=\"213\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><b>Step 2: Evaluate the fractional power.</b>\n</p><p>The real cube root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c53461a16fbd957e4d6ed2b4a30b8278de3666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1/125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c9555ed97aa152573debebc0b11476fcf70eb19f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1/5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/8/0488e52f94c3c6ab031ebe5a6ea477084df2c2a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(-\\frac1{125}\\right)^{2/3}=\\left(-\\frac15\\right)^2=\\frac1{25}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"231\" height=\"49\" />\nTherefore the required value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <